  "steps": [
    "Dry-roast 1 tbsp chana dal, ½ tbsp urad dal, ½ tsp cumin seeds in a pan over medium heat until fragrant. Set aside.",
    "To the same pan add ½ tbsp oil, 4 dried red chillies, 3 garlic cloves, Add 1 small onion, cubed, and cook until golden brown.",
    "Add 3 cubed tomatoes (roughly three times the quantity of onion), Along with 1 tsp salt, ¼ tsp turmeric. Cook until the tomatoes become soft and mushy, then set aside to cool.",
    "Blend the roasted lentils and cumin seeds into a fine powder. Add the cooked tomato mixture and blend until smooth, adding a little water if needed to achieve your preferred consistency.",
    "For the tadka, heat 1 tbsp oil. Once hot, switch off the flame, Add ¼ tsp mustard seeds, 5–6 curry leaves. Pour the tadka over the chutney, and it’s ready to serve!"
  ],
